meta {
  name: 09 - Audit trail
  type: http
  seq: 9
}
get {
  url: {{base_url}}/audit
  auth: none
}
headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}
docs {
  Every request: user, correlation ID, action, patient ID, outcome, denial reason.

  Run requests 04-07 first, then this. You should see respond/success,
  respond/refused, and the 401 denial -- each with the real FHIR patient id.
}
